</blockquote>
<p>This sentence should use &quot;obtaining&quot; instead of &quot;attaining&quot;.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>After <strong>attaining</strong> his address and contact information, Researcher Lin volunteered to interview Rainbow under the guise of a civilian seeking to learn about OneLeap.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I think a typo swapped out a &quot;v&quot; in favour of an &quot;n&quot;.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>With the invention of Q-Learning and exploration strategies, we see a 300% decrease in the Di<strong>n</strong>ine Radiation that chatbot AIs give off.</p>
