<p>I love this! I had a sense of unease throughout the article, but Rainbow had almost convinced me until Lin took the leap. +1 from me.</p>
<p>I am confused about some stuff though. For instance, if Lin's body was found on the rocks, how did the camera record anything in the sky? And if her experience was less corporeal than we thought, why can't Olivia's body be found? Or why do they need to create duplicate bodies?</p>
<p>Lin's body being found is the real confusing thing, but I enjoyed this nontheless.</p>

