			<div class="content" id="post-content-4837432">
									

<p>The experience isn't less corporeal at all.</p>
<p>Olivia went up and, since she probably didn't questioned herself, stayed up to the very end.</p>
<p>Lin went up, met the entity, doubted it and opened her eyes. When she opened her eyes she fell before the very end of the phenomena.</p>
<p>Keep in mind this last log is a video feed recorded in her computer. Lin saw nothing of the description, it was the actual camera. Only after she doubts the entity does she open her eyes and see anything at all. And as it seems, what she sees is something the camera can't get because of the light from behind the entity.</p>

